.Dd July 27, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-SH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-sh , rgosh
.Nd interactive remote shell over Reticulum
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm sh
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl compat
.Op Fl line
.Op Fl raw
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Ar destination_hash command ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Provides an SSH-like interactive shell over an encrypted Reticulum link and
channel. The default native protocol uses destination app
.Dq rgosh .
.Fl compat
speaks the Python
.Nm rnsh
wire protocol (app
.Dq rnsh ,
umsgpack message bodies).
.Pp
Listen mode
.Pq Fl l
accepts sessions. Initiator mode takes a destination hash and optional remote
command. Identity allowlists use
.Fl a
or allowed_identities files. Forced command mode
.Pq Fl C
ignores remote argv.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-x 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
